OL,3,CEd Miliband avoids questions over
OL,4,Ccalling Trump an 'idiot' and a 'racist'
OL,6,FEd Miliband hailed the US as the UK's
OL,7,F'closest ally' following talks with
OL,8,Fhis counterpart in Washington ` while
OL,9,Fdodging awkward questions on his
OL,10,Fprevious criticisms of Donald Trump.
OL,12,FAfter Trump's first election victory
OL,13,Fin 2016, Miliband, then working as a
OL,14,Fbackbencher when Labour was not in
OL,15,Fpower, Miliband described told BBC
OL,16,FRadio 4 that the President was an
OL,17,F"idiot, a racist and a misogynist".
OL,26,@yD@AOUyD@bO]
