OL,3,CEd Miliband avoids questions over
OL,4,Ccalling Trump an 'idiot' and a 'racist'
OL,6,FHowever these comments "didn't come
OL,7,Fup" during talks with his counterpart
OL,8,FMarco Rubio at the US State
OL,9,FDepartment, which Miliband described
OL,10,Fas "very productive".
OL,12,FMiliband insisted that the partnership
OL,13,Fwith Washington endures and that it
OL,14,Fwould do so "through successive
OL,15,Fadministrations".
OL,17,FEarlier, he'd ignored questions about
OL,18,Fwhether he still had such a low view
OL,19,Fof Trump.
OL,26,@vD@MOUwD@PO]
