OL,3,CEd Miliband avoids questions over
OL,4,Ccalling Trump an 'idiot' and a 'racist'
OL,6,FSmiling as he shook hands with Rubio,
OL,7,Fthe foreign secretary ducked shouted
OL,8,Finquiries by reporters about his
OL,9,Fprevious strident views on Trump, and
OL,10,Fsaid: "We are looking forward to our
OL,11,Fmeeting."
OL,13,FMiliband was invited to the US capital
OL,14,Fby Rubio after their recent first
OL,15,Fmeeting on the sidelines of a foreign
OL,16,Fministers' summit in the Philippines
OL,17,Flast month.
OL,19,FThe pair discussed efforts to reopen
OL,20,Fthe Strait of Hormuz, the Ukraine war
OL,21,Fand the situation in Gaza.
OL,26,@rD@GOUsD@IO]
