OL,3,CEd Miliband avoids questions over
OL,4,Ccalling Trump an 'idiot' and a 'racist'
OL,6,FThe dynamic between the two men was
OL,7,Fclosely watched as the White House was
OL,8,Falso reported to be concerned about
OL,9,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham's decision
OL,10,Fto hand Miliband the Foreign Office
OL,11,Fbrief.
OL,13,FIn his previous role as energy
OL,14,Fsecretary, Miliband was a strong
OL,15,Fchampion of net zero and renewables,
OL,16,Fwhile Mr Trump is a vocal supporter of
OL,17,Ffossil fuels, including opening up
OL,18,FNorth Sea oil, and an avowed opponent
OL,19,Fof "windmills".
OL,26,@{D@DOU{D@NO]
