OL,3,CEd Miliband avoids questions over
OL,4,Ccalling Trump an 'idiot' and a 'racist'
OL,6,FSince arriving in Downing Street,
OL,7,FBurnham has signalled a shift in
OL,8,Fenergy policy, earning praise from the
OL,9,FOval Office.
OL,11,FWashington's ambassador to the UK
OL,12,FWarren Stephens said recently that Mr
OL,13,FMiliband had been "wrong" in 2016 to
OL,14,Fcall Trump "a racist, misogynistic,
OL,15,Fself-confessed groper" and that
OL,16,F"hopefully his views have changed".
OL,18,FHe also pledged to work with Miliband
OL,19,Fin his new role, despite their
OL,20,Fdisagreement on green issues.
