OL,3,CEd Miliband avoids questions over
OL,4,Ccalling Trump an 'idiot' and a 'racist'
OL,6,FAsked following his talks with Rubio
OL,7,Fwhether he thought his previous
OL,8,Fstatements about Mr Trump had hampered
OL,9,Frelations with the US administration,
OL,10,FMr Miliband said: "No, and in fact
OL,11,Fthey didn't come up today.
OL,26,@rD@SOU
