OL,3,CEd Miliband avoids questions over
OL,4,Ccalling Trump an 'idiot' and a 'racist'
OL,6,F"We had a very productive 90-minute
OL,7,Fconversation, in which we talked
OL,8,Fabout, yes, about Iran, but about how
OL,9,Fwe can stand shoulder to shoulder with
OL,10,FUkraine against Russian aggression,
OL,11,Fabout how we can work towards
OL,12,Frelieving the terrible suffering we're
OL,13,Fseeing in Gaza, and a two-state
OL,14,Fsolution for security of the Israeli
OL,15,Fand Palestinian people.
OL,17,F"And we talked about a range of other
OL,18,Fissues," he said, adding: "What I know
OL,19,Fis that the US is our closest ally.
OL,26,@nD@AOUyD@AOUzD@HO]zD@[OU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/11
