OL,3,CEd Miliband avoids questions over
OL,4,Ccalling Trump an 'idiot' and a 'racist'
OL,6,F"They're our closest ally when it
OL,7,Fcomes to the importance of our
OL,8,Feconomic partnership, our defence
OL,9,Fpartnership, our security partnership,
OL,10,Four intelligence partnership.
OL,12,F"That partnership endures, and it
OL,13,Fendures through successive
OL,14,Fadministrations, and it will endure in
OL,15,Fthe future."
OL,17,FMiliband said a large part of his
OL,18,Fdiscussions with Rubio had focused on
OL,19,Fsecuring a "lasting ceasefire" in the
OL,20,FIran war, which he argued would help
OL,21,Ftackle the cost-of-living crisis.
