OL,11,FThe Strait of Hormuz waterway, which
OL,12,Fhad been open before the US and Israel
OL,13,Flaunched the military offensive in
OL,14,FFebruary, has been a flashpoint in the
OL,15,FMiddle East conflict and disruption to
OL,16,Ftrade has driven up fuel and food
OL,17,Fprices.
