OL,3,CEd Miliband avoids questions over
OL,4,Ccalling Trump an 'idiot' and a 'racist'
OL,6,FMiliband said: "People should be in no
OL,7,Fdoubt, I know, as Foreign Secretary,
OL,8,Fthat the British people are worried
OL,9,Fabout what's happened to petrol
OL,10,Fprices, diesel prices, energy bills,
OL,11,Fand the single biggest thing we can do
OL,12,Fis get that ceasefire in relation to
OL,13,FIran."
OL,15,FIn his report of the talks, Rubio
OL,16,Fnotably made no reference to the so-
OL,17,Fcalled "special relationship" with the
OL,18,FUK, and simply referred to the topics
OL,19,Fcovered in the discussions.
