OL,6,FPosting pictures of himself with
OL,7,FMiliband on X, he wrote: "In my
OL,8,Fmeeting with UK Foreign Secretary Ed
OL,9,FMiliband, we discussed the need for
OL,10,FEurope to take a greater role in its
OL,11,Fown security.
OL,13,F"We also reaffirmed our shared
OL,14,Fcommitment to open transit in the
OL,15,FStrait of Hormuz and ensuring Iran
OL,16,Fnever obtains a nuclear weapon."
